      "Only 24 g of protein per scoop"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The pick for tested athletes and anyone who wants a well-documented whey on the Kroger shelf.",
    "specs": {
      "Protein / serving": "24 g (label)",
      "Cost per 25 g": "About $1.55-1.70 (1.5 lb)",
      "Third-party tested": "NSF Certified for Sport (some flavors)",
