    "pros": [
      "USDA Organic and dairy-free",
      "Easy to find across Kroger banners, with many flavors",
      "Some listings marked SNAP EBT eligible"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "About $2.60-2.85 per 25 g in the small tub",
      "Erythritol and stevia sweetness is not for everyone",
      "No sport certification"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The organic pick on the shelf. Buy it for the label, not the price per gram.",
    "specs": {
